     <article class="story single" data-beat="education">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">EDUCATION</span> · Education (aggregate) · 2026-10-05 · editor 8/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Dhaval Patel Warns Indian Students on High US Master's Costs and H-1B Challenges</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#US Education</span> <span>#Indian Students</span> <span>#Master's Degree</span> <span>#H-1B Visa</span></div>
       <p>Indian students considering higher education in the United States are being advised to proceed with caution, particularly regarding the financial outlay and career prospects. A US master's degree can cost approximately $100,000, a significant investment that requires careful consideration.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-05/dhaval-patel-warns-indian-students-on-high-us-masters-costs-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Dhaval Patel has issued a warning specifically to Indian students, highlighting potential difficulties in the job market and challenges associated with the H-1B visa process post-graduation. These factors could impact a student's ability to secure employment and remain in the US after completing their studies.</p><p>The advisory underscores the need for prospective students to thoroughly research and understand the economic and immigration landscape before committing to a US master's program.</p><p>What to watch: Further advisories and discussions on international student career pathways.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately captures the warning from Dhaval Patel and the $100,000 cost for a US master's degree.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.?oc=5&amp;hl=en-US&amp;gl=US&amp;ceid=US:en" rel="noopener">Education (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
