     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Variety · 2026-10-05 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Kieran Culkin Expresses Interest in Returning as the Devil on Family Guy</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actor Kieran Culkin has expressed a strong desire to continue voicing the character of the Devil on the animated series Family Guy. Following his recent appearance on the show, Culkin noted that he thoroughly enjoyed the experience and found the creative process engaging.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-05/kieran-culkin-expresses-interest-in-returning-as-the-devil-o.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Production teams confirmed that Culkin was highly enthusiastic during the recording sessions. The actor explicitly requested to reprise the role should the character return in future episodes of the long-running series, signaling a potential ongoing collaboration between the star and the show's creators.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately captures the essence of the source material regarding Kieran Culkin's interest in the role.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://variety.com/2026/tv/news/family-guy-kieran-culkin-devil-halloween-special-hulu-2-1236897209/" rel="noopener">Variety</a></li></ul>
