     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-05 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Sachin Kumar Yadav Appointed Managing Director of KFON</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Sachin Kumar Yadav assumed charge as the Managing Director of the Kerala Fibre Optic Network (KFON) on October 2, 2026. Yadav, who also serves as the Director of the Kerala State IT Mission, currently holds additional responsibilities as CEO of Technopark and Director of the Kerala State Remote Sensing and Environment Centre.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-05/sachin-kumar-yadav-appointed-managing-director-of-kfon.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Simultaneously, KFON reached a significant milestone by surpassing two lakh total connections. The network now serves 2,00,073 subscribers, including households, government offices, businesses, and Below the Poverty Line families, supported by a 34,505 km fibre infrastructure and approximately 3,800 local network providers.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is accurate, concise, and captures all key figures and statistics provided in the source text.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/sachin-yadav-assumes-charge-as-kfon-md/article71537067.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-05/sachin-kumar-yadav-appointed-managing-director-of-kfon" data-title="Sachin Kumar Yadav Appointed Managing Director of KFON"><b>Share:</b>
