       <h1>Sara Gurpal Injured During Rise and Fall 2 Task</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Contestant Sara Gurpal sustained a forehead injury while competing in a high-intensity gunpowder collection task on Rise and Fall 2. Despite the injury caused by her protective helmet, Gurpal continued the challenge without seeking immediate medical attention to support her team.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-05/sara-gurpal-injured-during-rise-and-fall-2-task.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Following the Workers’ loss, Gurpal engaged in a heated confrontation with Shehzad Poonawalla, labeling the verdict biased. She expressed frustration toward the Penthouse contestants, accusing them of lacking empathy despite witnessing the team’s physical efforts throughout the demanding competition.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately captures the incident and the core conflict from the source text.</p>
